{
  "id": "1168",
  "title": "My Birthday",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2021-01-06",
  "synopsis": "Read about how I celebrated my eighth birthday!",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1168/a4e37ab781fcfbac2018560ebf40b1be5261c1d0.mp3?1608993649",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "过生日\n\n    今天是我的生日，我今年八岁了。很多朋友送我礼物。\n    下午，爸爸、妈妈带我去吃饭，我吃了很多很多。吃了饭，爸爸妈妈带我买了车，我喜欢车。回家的时候，爸爸和妈妈买了生日蛋糕，蛋糕很好吃，我很喜欢。\n    今天我很高兴，过生日真好！",
    "traditional": "過生日\n\n    今天是我的生日，我今年八歲了。很多朋友送我禮物。\n    下午，爸爸、媽媽帶我去吃飯，我吃了很多很多。吃了飯，爸爸媽媽帶我買了車，我喜歡車。回家的時候，爸爸和媽媽買了生日蛋糕，蛋糕很好吃，我很喜歡。\n    今天我很高興，過生日真好！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My Birthday"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天是我的生日，我今年八岁了。",
      "traditional": "今天是我的生日，我今年八歲了。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì wǒ de shēng rì wǒ jīn nián bā suì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "很多朋友送我礼物。",
      "traditional": "很多朋友送我禮物。",
      "pinyin": "hěn duō péng you sòng wǒ lǐ wù",
      "english": "It’s my birthday today, and I’m turning eight years old."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A lot of friends gave me gifts."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "下午，爸爸、妈妈带我去吃饭，我吃了很多很多。",
      "traditional": "下午，爸爸、媽媽帶我去吃飯，我吃了很多很多。",
      "pinyin": "xià wǔ bà ba mā ma dài wǒ qù chī fàn wǒ chī le hěn duō hěn duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "吃了饭，爸爸妈妈带我买了车，我喜欢车。",
      "traditional": "吃了飯，爸爸媽媽帶我買了車，我喜歡車。",
      "pinyin": "chī le fàn bà ba mā ma dài wǒ mǎi le chē wǒ xǐ huan chē",
      "english": "In the afternoon, Mom and Dad took me out to eat. I ate lots and lots."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "回家的时候，爸爸和妈妈买了生日蛋糕，蛋糕很好吃，我很喜欢。",
      "traditional": "回家的時候，爸爸和媽媽買了生日蛋糕，蛋糕很好吃，我很喜歡。",
      "pinyin": "huí jiā de shí hou bà ba hé mā ma mǎi le shēng rì dàn gāo dàn gāo hěn hǎo chī wǒ hěn xǐ huan",
      "english": "After eating, Mom and Dad took me to go buy a car. I like cars."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "On the way home, Mom and Dad bought a birthday cake. The cake was very delicious. I liked it a lot."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "今天我很高兴，过生日真好！",
      "traditional": "今天我很高興，過生日真好！",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ hěn gāo xìng guò shēng rì zhēn hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m so happy today. Birthdays are so great!"
    }
  ],
